


    <section class="team">

      <div class="container">
          <h1>TEAM CIRCULAR</h1>
          <p class="text-center">Contact us</p>
          <div class="row">

            <div class="col-md-4 text-center">
                <div class="profile">
                  <%= image_tag "massimo galeotti.jpeg" , class: "user" %>
                  <blockquote>
I've always wanted to change the world. Circular was born from this, from the desire to change the world for the better. I firmly believe that owning items has become a luxury for the few. I created Circular to allow people to own everything without necessarily having it. Circular wants to give the user the experience of pleasure that derives from things, not from owning.
                  </blockquote>
                  <h3>Massimo Galeotti <span>ITA</span></h3>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4 text-center">
                <div class="profile">
                  <%= image_tag "Peter.jpg" , class: "user" %>
                  <blockquote>As Jane Goodall said: "The greatest danger to our future is apathy. Sustainibility is our only way forward. Circular is a crucial step towards a true sharing economy".
                  </blockquote>
                  <h3>Peter Westman <span>USA</span></h3>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4 text-center">
                <div class="profile">
                  <%= image_tag "Fernando.jpg" , class: "user" %>
                  <blockquote>We need to rethink the way we consume. Our society buys so many products which after a brief period of use end up in landfills. It is worth finding a way to extend the life of those products and put them back in circulation. We must try to solve the threat posed by increased waste. Our planet needs it and so do all of us.
                  </blockquote>
                  <h3>Fernando Lazzarin <span>BRZ</span></h3>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4 text-center">
                <div class="profile">
                  <%= image_tag "Davide.jpeg" , class: "user" %>
                  <blockquote>I've always wanted to change the world. Circular was born from this, from the desire to change the world for the better.
                  </blockquote>
                  <h3>Davide Varni <span>ITA</span></h3>
                </div>
            </div>


          </div>
      </div>
    </section>





























































